{"seq":2,"slug":"ahimsa","title":"非暴力","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/mahatma-gandhi/political-thought/ahimsa","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"the-principle-of-ahimsa","title":"非暴力的原则","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/mahatma-gandhi/political-thought/ahimsa/the-principle-of-ahimsa","wordCount":1898,"readingTime":8},{"seq":2,"slug":"love-over-hatred","title":"以爱化解仇恨","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/mahatma-gandhi/political-thought/ahimsa/love-over-hatred","wordCount":1905,"readingTime":8}],"introMarkdown":"# 非暴力\n\n非暴力（Ahimsa），是甘地思想最核心、最广为人知的原则。本章揭示其深刻内涵。\n\n第一篇文档讲述\"非暴力的原则\"——它作为根本道德信仰而非单纯策略的真义。第二篇文档讲述\"以爱化解仇恨\",呈现他以爱战胜恨、转化对手的崇高精神。\n"}